  "content": "<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n\n\n      <div class=\"bg-center bg-cover wb-init wb-bgimg-inited\" data-bgimg-srcset=\"/content/dam/cci-icc/images/CCI-IP-page-banner-1200x726.jpg 992w, 991w\" id=\"wb-auto-4\" style='background-image: url(\"/content/dam/cci-icc/images/CCI-IP-page-banner-1200x726.jpg\");'>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"col-md-7\">\n          <h1 property=\"name\" id=\"wb-cont\" dir=\"ltr\"> Canadian Conservation Institute</h1>\n          <p>The Canadian Conservation Institute (CCI), a Special Operating Agency within  the <a href=\"/en/canadian-heritage.html\">Department of Canadian Heritage</a>, advances and promotes the  conservation of heritage collections in Canada through its expertise in conservation science, treatment and preventive  conservation. <abbr title=\"Canadian Conservation Institute\">CCI</abbr> works with heritage institutions and professionals  to ensure these heritage collections are preserved and accessible to Canadians  now and in the future.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <section class=\"gc-most-requested\"><div class=\"container\">\n      <h2>Most requested</h2>\n      <ul><li><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/corporate/emergency-advice.html\"><strong>Emergency advice</strong></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://app.pch.gc.ca/application/formulaires-forms/bull/index.app?lang=en\"><strong>CCI e-News</strong></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/services/conservation-preservation-publications.html\"><strong>CCI publications</strong></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/services/videos.html\"><strong>CCI videos</strong></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://app.pch.gc.ca/application/cdl-ldc/description-about.app?lang=en\"><strong>Light Damage Calculator</strong></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/services/agents-deterioration.html\"><strong>Agents of deterioration</strong></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/services/preventive-conservation/framework-preserving-heritage-collections.html\">Framework for Preserving Heritage Collections</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/corporate/org-structure.html\"><strong>Conservation experts</strong></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/services/conservation-treatments-services/conservation-services-indigenous-collections.html\"><strong>Conservation services for Indigenous cultural centres and collections</strong></a></li>\n      </ul></div>\n  </section><div class=\"container mrgn-bttm-lg\">\n    <section class=\"gc-srvinfo\"><h2 class=\"wb-inv\">Services and information</h2>\n      <div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd\">\n        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n          <h3><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/services/care-objects.html\">Care of objects and collections</a></h3>\n          <p>Understand and care for objects and materials commonly found in cultural heritage collections.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n          <h3><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/services/internships.html\">Internships</a></h3>\n          <p>Discover the many internship opportunities  designed to provide practical experience in the field of conservation and  conservation science.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n          <h3><a href=\"/en/services/culture/history-heritage/museology-conservation/preservation-conservation/preventive-conservation.html\">Preventive conservation and risk management</a></h3>\n          <p>Prevent the deterioration of artefacts and collections by avoiding environmental and other threats and learn about dealing with objects that have become damaged.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n          <h3><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/services/learning-activities.html\">Learning activities </a></h3>\n          <p>Get involved in learning activities  that support cultural heritage institutions and professionals.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n          <h3><a href=\"/en/services/culture/history-heritage/museology-conservation/preservation-conservation/professional-services.html\">Professional conservation services</a></h3>\n          <p>Consult the list of professional services available to cultural heritage institutions, including conservation treatments, scientific analysis of objects and materials, facilities assessments, archaeological conservation services and environmental monitoring equipment loans.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n          <h3><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/corporate/research-development.html\">Research and development</a></h3>\n          <p>See the research priorities and types of research <abbr title=\"Canadian Conservation Institute\">CCI</abbr> provides to the heritage community.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n          <h3><a href=\"/en/services/culture/history-heritage/museology-conservation/preservation-conservation/tools-resources.html\">Conservation tools and resources</a></h3>\n          <p>Browse  publications, software tools, the <abbr title=\"Canadian Conservation Institute\">CCI</abbr> library collection and other resources available to assist conservation professionals and those responsible for collections care.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n          <h3><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/corporate/heritage-places.html\">Heritage places</a></h3>\n          <p>Learn more on how <abbr title=\"Canadian Conservation Institute\">CCI</abbr> contributes to the preservation of heritage places.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6\">\n          <h3><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/corporate/conservation-news.html\">Conservation news</a></h3>\n          <p>Browse through news, job postings and highlights from <abbr title=\"Canadian Conservation Institute\">CCI</abbr>. You can also subscribe to e-News to receive email updates on <abbr title=\"Canadian Conservation Institute\">CCI</abbr>'s activities.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section></div>\n  <div class=\"well well-sm brdr-0 mrgn-bttm-md\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <section><h2>Contact us</h2><ul class=\"wb-eqht list-unstyled mrgn-tp-lg lst-spcd-2 colcount-md-3 bold-content wb-init wb-eqht-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-5\"><li style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 65px;\"><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/corporate/contact.html\">Canadian Conservation Institute</a></li>\n          <li style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 65px;\"><a href=\"/en/heritage-information-network/corporate/contact.html\">Canadian Heritage Information Network</a></li>\n          <li style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 65px;\"><a href=\"/en/canadian-heritage/contact-us.html\">Department of Canadian Heritage</a></li>\n        </ul></section></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col-md-8\">\n        <section><h2>About the Canadian Conservation Institute</h2>\n          <ul class=\"list-unstyled bold-content mrgn-tp-lg lst-spcd-2 colcount-md-2\"><li><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/corporate/mission-mandate-values.html\">Mandate</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/corporate/org-structure.html\">Organizational structure</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/corporate/our-history.html\">Our history</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/services/conservation-preservation-publications/corporate-publications/strategic-plan-2021-2026.html\">Canadian Conservation Institute and Canadian Heritage Information Network Strategic Plan 2021-2026</a></li>\n          </ul></section></div>\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <section class=\"gc-followus\"><h2>On social media</h2>\n          <ul><li><a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://app.pch.gc.ca/application/formulaires-forms/bull/index.app?lang=en\"><span class=\"fas fa-envelope fa-lg mrgn-lft-md mrgn-rght-sm\"></span> <span class=\"wb-inv\">Subscribe to the</span>CCI e-News</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/cci.conservation/\" class=\"facebook mrgn-lft-sm\"><span class=\"wb-inv\">Facebook: </span>Canadian Conservation Institute </a> </li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/RCIPCHIN/\" rel=\"external\" class=\"youtube mrgn-lft-sm\"><span class=\"wb-inv\">Youtube: </span>CCI/ICC CHIN/RCIP</a> </li>\n          </ul></section></div>\n    </div>\n    <section class=\"gc-minister\"><div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd\">\n        <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6\">\n          <h2>Minister</h2>\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-7 pull-right\">\n              <h3><a href=\"/en/government/ministers/marc-miller.html\">The Honourable Marc Miller</a></h3>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-5\"> <img src=\"/content/dam/pch/images/ministers/marc-miller.jpg\" alt=\"The Honourable Marc Miller\"></div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-7\">\n              <p>Minister of Canadian Identity and Culture and Minister responsible for Official Languages</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6\">\n          <h2>Management</h2>\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-7 pull-right\">\n              <h3>Brigitte Gibson</h3>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-5\"> <img src=\"/content/dam/pch/images/ministers/brigitte-gibson.jpg\" alt=\"Brigitte Gibson\"></div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-7\">\n              <p>Director General, Heritage Branch</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section><section class=\"gc-features\"><h2>Features</h2>\n      <div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd\">\n        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-sm-6 hght-inhrt\">\n          <div class=\"well well-sm eqht-trgt hght-inhrt wb-init wb-eqht-grd-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-6\"> <img src=\"/content/dam/cci-icc/images/features/CCI-org-page-Feature.png\" alt=\"\"><h3><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/services/videos/video-about-canadian-conservation-institute.html\" class=\"stretched-link\">Who we are</a></h3>\n            <p>To learn more about our mission and mandate, watch our corporate video \"About the Canadian Conservation Institute.\"</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-sm-6 hght-inhrt\">\n          <div class=\"well well-sm eqht-trgt hght-inhrt wb-init wb-eqht-grd-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-7\"> <img src=\"/content/dam/cci-icc/images/features/recherche-research.jpg\" alt=\"\"><h3><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/corporate/org-structure.html#a2\" class=\"stretched-link\">Conservation experts</a></h3>\n            <p>Get to know our conservation experts!</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-sm-6 hght-inhrt\">\n          <div class=\"well well-sm eqht-trgt hght-inhrt wb-init wb-eqht-grd-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-8\"> <img src=\"/content/dam/cci-icc/images/features/microvieillissement-microfade.jpg\" alt=\"\"><h3><a href=\"/en/conservation-institute/services/microfade-testing-services.html\" class=\"stretched-link\">Microfade testing services</a></h3>\n            <p>Learn more about this quick and non-destructive way of identifying objects in your collections that are at a high risk of damage from exposure to light.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section></div>\n  \n\n\n</div>"
